==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Unbroken Bonds|Crabrawler|104}} from the {{TCG|Unbroken Bonds}} expansion.
*'''Knuckle Punch''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Neo Revelation|Geodude|44}} from the {{TCG|Neo Revelation}} expansion.
